  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "3b154687-8759-4335-8da4-8e0107e2c0be",
      "name": "說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## Demo 6 — 對話記憶\n\n**目的**：展示 AI Agent 如何記住對話歷史\n\n**核心元件**\n- AI Agent（對話代理）\n- Google Gemini Chat Model（語言模型）\n- Window Buffer Memory（記憶視窗：最近 10 輪對話）\n\n**Demo 步驟**\n1. 點左側 Chat 圖示開啟對話介面\n2. 問：「我叫小明」\n3. 再問：「你記得我的名字嗎？」\n4. 觀察 AI 能記住上下文\n\n**技術重點**\n- Window Buffer Memory 儲存最近 N 輪對話\n- 對話 session 以 sessionId 區分"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "30ee5d0a-3994-4f7d-a4ba-778161aee7cc",
      "name": "Chat Trigger",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "title": "Demo 6：IT 維運對話助理（有記憶）",
          "inputPlaceholder": "輸入你的問題...",
          "loadPreviousSession": "memory"
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "e0f1c618-410c-41c6-a2a0-25831cbb847b"
    },
    {
      "id": "35a78ca8-aa62-4880-8246-b6595051059c",
      "name": "AI Agent：對話助理",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        460,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "agent": "conversationalAgent",
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "你是 TSMC IT 維運助理。用繁體中文回答。回答要簡潔、準確，適合維運工程師。\n\n你可以記住這次對話的上下文，包括使用者提到的名字、設備、問題歷史。"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7d455db2-b5d9-4c83-a91b-18981711b077",
      "name": "Google Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        360,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "G7B3Jkm3AiKjF1gY",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2509ec9d-64dd-4329-a3fd-454b0e4adb2c",
      "name": "Window Buffer Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        560,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "contextWindowLength": 10,
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Chat Trigger').item.json.sessionId ?? 'demo' }}"
      }
    }
